flowchart TD
    Q{Does it live<br/>outside the browser?}
    Q -->|Yes| RQ[React Query<br/>cache, refetch, invalidate]
    Q -->|No| F{Is it form input?}
    F -->|Yes| RHF[React Hook Form + Zod<br/>validation & form state]
    F -->|No| U{Is it in the URL?<br/>filters, pagination, tabs}
    U -->|Yes| NAV[next/navigation<br/>useSearchParams / useRouter]
    U -->|No| C{Shared across<br/>components?}
    C -->|Yes| Z[Zustand store]
    C -->|No| L[Local useState / useReducer]